{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_3201_046rio", "source_sha256": "b8256c5a04f8c7ae295498649422da8fa5597e3dbeba5010b55da42ca5d70eb7", "ja": "ふぅん。確かに無難にまとまってるって感じよね。\n他に決め手もないし、こっちにしちゃいましょうか！", "zh": "哦，的确有中规中矩的感觉呢。\n也没有其他更好的选择，就选这个吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_3300_p", "source_sha256": "a2a2bb4c0d956fdd5324b649fba271f70be2fdb50eb7907ccf98c84bef22854e", "ja": "ピンクがいいんじゃないかな。\n柔らかいイメージになると思うんだけど。", "zh": "粉红色比较好吧？\n感觉会给人柔和的印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_3301_046rio", "source_sha256": "b8d9c2686c8122fd623f241f1ebb730814d23d5c87bb5bafa61991c3cdb2d5a1", "ja": "ウフフ、そんな気はしてたのよ♪　\nやっぱりピンクは、私を引き立てるわよね♪", "zh": "呵呵，我也有这种感觉喔♪\n还是粉红色更能衬托我呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_3302_046rio", "source_sha256": "e7468ad9a0dab8cf6156b672bed148c14930fa2c11c86b5c7dceca4f1df8eea9", "ja": "それじゃ、ピンクのシャツに着替えてくるわね！\n私の色気に悩殺されちゃダメよ？", "zh": "那我就去换上粉红色的衬衫啰！\n可别被我的性感迷得神魂颠倒啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_3400_p", "source_sha256": "a2a2bb4c0d956fdd5324b649fba271f70be2fdb50eb7907ccf98c84bef22854e", "ja": "ピンクがいいんじゃないかな。\n柔らかいイメージになると思うんだけど。", "zh": "粉红色比较好吧？\n感觉会给人柔和的印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
